  "description": "They say half of all decent men in the world are married, and the other half are gay. Yu-Jun has met all kinds of men throughout his life, but he’s had a hard time finding someone who perfectly matches his ideal type. Then, out of the blue, he runs into Kang Do-Ha on campus, a guy who checks all the boxes when it comes to looks and physique...\n\nWhat’s more, when Yu-Jun finds out that Kang Do-Ha is into men, he decides this is his chance and goes for it. \n\n *“I heard you like guys, what do you think of me?”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
